":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOZHJHc1c0ajVtN1BaNHA5eTVuSk9kZTlKaVUxLWVDT3drMFBSQTc5WjZEYUI0RXRXNnVTZHNXVlZLS2R6dXhGN1NnYlFNSDdBYUtidTdwZlJVWXZMMXJkcGtLOHQ1b04zcU5fV3dHcFhsZXduY0Vmcm9vNkJWWTRZWHl6dHliekxhcWl6b3VFaDNHMEk4U0dCT3RUNA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"陽獅百事可樂收購可口可樂併入 Omnicom 和 WPP"},{"title":"Taco Bell Deal Renewal Could Be A Game Changer For PepsiCo (PEP)","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"塔可鐘 (Taco Bell) 續約交易可能會改變百事可樂 (PEP) 的遊戲規則"},{"title":"Goldman cuts target for PepsiCo stock from USD 180 to USD 165 - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOMERJb0VqWFZObEN0U0lpY1lwa1lubG1XLW4xTEo1RGVkNXd4SGp0M1JURFJlRk5xaF9zdDRZVVFHNUJzWnN4MVFsVjVpRGlDT2tMMnJyV0VTWVlNZ25OUWFHN3h5Q0V3ZUdvNnBsR1FCbVlaSVBQMjltMUF6S2hwVndQd0JEcWhCRVpKOWVwMDNlLVV3VExHbTFDbHg0d0E0WGJZakg1MTVTNGJsSE94b1E3OUEtc3FqWE9TZ3puMUtEdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"高盛將百事可樂股票目標從 180 美元下調至 165 美元 - ad-hoc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":19},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-03","period":"2025-12-27","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/77476/000007747626000007/pep-20251227.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"When used in this report, the terms \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"PepsiCo\" and the \"Company\" mean PepsiCo, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, collectively. Certain terms used in this Annual Report on Form 10-K are defined in the Glossary included in Item 7. of this report.","zh":"本報告中使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「百事公司」和「公司」統指百事公司及其合併子公司。表格 10-K 年度報告中使用的某些術語在本報告第 7 項的術語表中進行了定義。"},{"en":"We were incorporated in Delaware in 1919 and reincorporated in North Carolina in 1986. We are a leading global beverage and convenient food company with a complementary portfolio of brands, including Lay's, Doritos, Cheetos, Gatorade, Pepsi-Cola, Mountain Dew, Quaker and SodaStream. Through our operations, authorized bottlers, contract manufacturers and other third parties, we make, market, distribute and sell a wide variety of beverages and convenient foods, serving customers and consumers in more than 200 countries and territories.","zh":"我們於 1919 年在特拉華州註冊成立，並於 1986 年在北卡羅來納州重新註冊。我們是一家全球領先的飲料和方便食品公司，擁有互補的品牌組合，包括樂事、多力多滋、奇多、佳得樂、百事可樂、激浪、桂格和 SodaStream。透過我們的業務、授權裝瓶商、合約製造商和其他第三方，我們生產、行銷、分銷和銷售各種飲料和方便食品，為 200 多個國家和地區的客戶和消費者提供服務。"},{"en":"3)International Beverages Franchise (IB Franchise), which includes our international franchise beverage businesses, as well as our SodaStream business;","zh":"3）國際飲料特許經營（IB Franchise），包括我們的國際特許經營飲料業務，以及我們的SodaStream業務；"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers include wholesale and other distributors, foodservice customers, grocery stores, drug stores, convenience stores, discount/dollar stores, mass merchandisers, membership stores, hard discounters, e-commerce retailers and authorized independent bottlers, among others. We normally grant our independent bottlers exclusive contracts to sell and manufacture certain beverage products bearing our trademarks within a specific geographic area. These arrangements provide us with the right to charge our independent bottlers for concentrate, finished goods and Aquafina royalties and specify the manufacturing process required for product quality. We also grant distribution rights to our independent bottlers for certain beverage products bearing our trademarks for specified geographic areas.","zh":"我們的客戶包括批發商和其他經銷商、餐飲服務客戶、雜貨店、藥局、便利商店、折扣/一元商店、量販店、會員商店、硬折扣店、電子商務零售商和授權獨立裝瓶商等。我們通常授予獨立裝瓶商獨家合同，在特定地理區域內銷售和製造帶有我們商標的某些飲料產品。這些安排使我們有權向獨立裝瓶商收取濃縮物、成品和 Aquafina 特許權使用費，並指定產品品質所需的製造流程。我們也向獨立裝瓶商授予某些帶有我們商標的特定地理區域飲料產品的經銷權。"},{"en":"We rely on and provide financial incentives to our customers to assist in the distribution and promotion of our products to the consumer. For our independent distributors and retailers, these incentives include volume-based rebates, product placement fees, promotions and displays. For our independent bottlers, these incentives are referred to as bottler funding and are negotiated annually with each bottler to support a variety of trade and consumer programs, such as consumer incentives, advertising support, new product support, and vending and cooler equipment placement. Consumer incentives include pricing discounts and promotions, and other promotional offers. Advertising support is directed at advertising programs and supporting independent bottler media. New product support includes targeted consumer and retailer incentives and direct marketplace support, such as point-of-purchase mat","zh":"我們依靠客戶並向客戶提供經濟激勵，以協助向消費者分銷和推廣我們的產品。對於我們的獨立經銷商和零售商來說，這些激勵措施包括基於數量的回扣、產品植入費用、促銷和展示。對於我們的獨立裝瓶商來說，這些激勵措施被稱為裝瓶商資金，每年與每個裝瓶商協商，以支持各種貿易和消費者計劃，例如消費者激勵、廣告支持、新產品支持以及自動售貨和冷卻設備安置。消費者激勵措施包括定價折扣和促銷以及其他促銷優惠。廣告支援針對廣告計畫和支援獨立裝瓶商媒體。新產品支援包括有針對性的消費者和零售商激勵措施以及直接市場支持，例如購買點墊"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"Pepsi Co Beverages North America","val":28197000000,"zh":"百事可樂公司飲料北美"},{"name":"Pepsi Co Foods North America","val":27528000000,"zh":"百事可樂食品北美公司"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africa","val":18025000000,"zh":"歐洲 中東 非洲 部門"},{"name":"Latin America Foods","val":10549000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲食品部門"},{"name":"International Beverage Franchise","val":4997000000,"zh":"國際飲料特許經營"},{"name":"Asia Pacific Foods","val":4629000000,"zh":"亞太食品部門"}],"total":93925000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"US","val":52228000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"All Other Countries","val":17941000000,"zh":"所有其他國家"},{"name":"MX","val":6947000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"RU","val":4768000000,"zh":"魯"},{"name":"CA","val":3729000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"CN","val":2621000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"GB","val":2142000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"BR","val":1782000000,"zh":"BR"},{"name":"ZA","val":1767000000,"zh":"札阿"}],"total":93925000000}},"peers":["PG","KO","JNJ","MMM","WMT"]}}